# Virtual environments
venv*/

# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# NOTE: realesrgan-ncnn-vulkan/ (upscaler exe + model weights, ~51MB) is
# intentionally NOT ignored — it's committed to the repo so the app works
# out of the box with no separate download step. Un-ignoring it here would
# not remove it from git history; that would need a separate cleanup plus
# a real download-on-first-run mechanism to replace it.
# weights/

